    "category": "Non-Automatic Weighing Instrument",
    "type_designations": ["NCR 7879-2XXX", "NCR 7879-5XXX"],
    "module_designation": null,
    "description": "NCR 7879-2XXX and 7879-5XXX series (where XXX denotes alternative approved models) scanner/scale, accuracy class III, mains operated, self-indicating, weight only, non-automatic weighing instrument. Designed for flush-mounting in checkout surface; can be used in Self Check-Out Systems (SCO); steel framework supporting a barcode scanner, electronics, and four load cells; NCR 7825 remote pole-mounted display unit; integrated barcode imagers; interface for POS connection; remote power supply module. The 7879-5XXX has frame extensions to support the instrument in the checkout counter and a smaller load receptor than the 7879-2XXX; the 7879-2XXX can be mounted into an optional stainless steel mounting bracket and has a 2.5 cm longer extended weigh plate; the 7879-5XXX features an optional stainless steel weigh plate comprising two separate sheets covering the weighing platform. Equipped with an integrated single character seven segment display also used to provide audit trail information from two event counters; the calibration button can be sealed using label or lead and wire methods."
